00:45:06.277 --> 00:45:07.360
please rate your sessions.

00:45:07.360 --> 00:45:10.568
I apologize, but if you
would, that would be great.

00:45:10.568 --> 00:45:11.860
And I'm going to say thank you.

00:45:11.860 --> 00:45:14.130
I hope you enjoy the rest of
Next, and have a good day.

